# Use Latest Stable Versions Rule

Use the latest stable versions of tools, packages and runtimes. No alpha, beta or RC unless required. Never hand-set version ranges: run `pnpm syncpack:fix`. Published packages set `engines.node` to the oldest upstream-supported Node.js version.

Details: `docs/DEPENDENCIES.md`. Summary rules: `AGENTS.md`.
